    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Picture this: You get into a car and "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "fasten",
            "ref": "v-fasten"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " your seat belt. The car is driving by itself!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Self-driving cars look like "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "vehicles",
            "ref": "v-vehicle"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " you see on the road. Some of them can carry people. Others are made to carry "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "cargo",
            "zh": "货物"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Self-driving cars don’t need people to drive them. The cars have a computer. The computer "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "decides",
            "ref": "v-decide"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " where to turn and how fast to go. They use "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "GPS",
            "zh": "全球定位系统"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "keep track of",
            "zh": "追踪，了解"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " where they are. So they never "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "get lost",
            "ref": "v-get-lost"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "Cameras",
            "ref": "v-camera"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " on the car “watch” other cars and people on the road. "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Sensors",
            "zh": "传感器"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " on the car take in "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "information",
            "ref": "v-information"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " about the lights and sounds around the car."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The cameras and sensors then send information to the car’s computer. The computer uses this information to drive the car."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In the future, self-driving cars could be safer, faster and easier to use. No need to learn to drive. Your car may take you "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "wherever",
            "zh": "无论哪里"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " you want to go!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "n1",
        "type": "note",
        "title": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Did you know?"
          }
        ],
        "content": [
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "无人驾驶的核心技术体系主要分为感知、决策、执行三个层面。感知系统相当于人的眼睛、耳朵，负责感知周围的环境，并采集处理信息；决策系统相当于人的大脑，负责数据整合、路径规划、导航和判断决策；执行系统相当于人的小脑和四肢，负责汽车的各项驾驶动作。"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "由于在短期内无法实现绝对的智能和绝对的安全，目前人们能够享受的“自动驾驶”实际上是让司机开车更轻松的“辅助驾驶”。"
            }
          ]
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
